# The Bishop's third job node: an orb hurled forward, striking as it drifts,
# then bursting into a light that hits wider and hands the party a buff.
#
# GMS's readout carries TWO sixes and they are different things. `mobCount` is
# the six enemies a beat reaches; the "Max Contact Count: 6" beside it is a
# separate budget, and the sentence after it says only the recovery spends one.
# So the contacts cap how many party members the orb can heal, never how often
# it strikes.
#
# How often it strikes is published nowhere. The beat is GMS's `attackDelay`,
# 350ms; the count is the community DPM calculator's three, and the orb's own
# speed works out the same -- 600 pixels at `v 12`, six times slower than the
# F/P's projectiles, keeps a 220-pixel body over a boss for about three beats.
#
# The buff is FINAL damage: Holy Light is its own skill, 400021077, and states
# it as `indieDamR`. Twelve seconds against a ten-second wait means the Bishop
# holds it permanently, which is the point of the skill -- namu has a Bishop
# pressing this every ten seconds as the backbone of the cycle.
#
# The orb and the light both land when the cast ends. GMS flies the orb out
# over three quarters of a second first, and nothing here has anywhere for it
# to fly.
#
# The three beats fall TOGETHER rather than on their own clock: a swing told
# apart by `cast_interval_ms` re-lands the whole of itself on every beat, and
# the whole of this one is the light as well as the orb. Telling them apart
# would burst the light three times. Over the 700ms they would have spanned
# the map does not move anyway.
#
# Dropped: the 350 MP, untracked; the recast that dismisses an orb already out,
# moot on a ten-second wait; and the immunity to attack reflection, which
# nothing here has.
name: "Peacemaker"
description:
  "Hurl the embodiment of divine power directly at your enemies. Upon contact "
  "the power both damages them and restores your HP. As it disappears the "
  "object transforms into Holy Light, attacking enemies nearby and granting a "
  "buff to party members."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_HOLY
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP_V skill_order: 3 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 660
cooldown_seconds: 10.0
max_enemies: 6
lines: 4
casts: 3
base {
  skill_pct: 3.64
  hp_recover_pct: 0.45
}
per_level { skill_pct: 0.14 }
extra_hit {
  label: "Holy Light"
  max_enemies: 15
  lines: 12
  base { skill_pct: 3.64 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.14 }
}
buff {
  duration_seconds: 12.0
  base { final_dmg_pct: 0.172 }
  per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.002 }
  ally_base { final_dmg_pct: 0.172 }
  ally_per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.002 }
}
